30:04.533 --> 30:06.200
Kang Sun Young!

30:13.067 --> 30:14.700
Tae Joo!

30:15.467 --> 30:17.633
Tae Joo!

30:17.633 --> 30:18.933
Tae Joo...

30:18.933 --> 30:20.433
Apa dah berlaku, Tae Joo?

30:20.433 --> 30:22.800
Sun Young...

30:22.800 --> 30:25.367
- Sun Young?
- Sun Young...

30:25.367 --> 30:27.133
Sun Young...

30:29.867 --> 30:34.367
Tae Joo, itu bukan Sun Young. Itu bukan dia.

30:34.367 --> 30:36.167
Itu bukan dia.

30:37.067 --> 30:38.867
Lihat, itu bukan Sun Young, kan?

30:38.867 --> 30:42.233
Ayah dah pesan supaya jangan pergi
