30:42.233 --> 30:44.800
Ayah dah pesan, kan?

30:44.800 --> 30:46.467
Tae Joo!

30:47.900 --> 30:50.000
Kami dah jumpa Sun Young!

30:51.433 --> 30:53.900
Kami dah jumpa Sun Young!

