36:38.300 --> 36:40.567
Pastikan dia terima balasannya!

36:40.567 --> 36:42.767
Ya, ayah.

36:42.767 --> 36:44.667
Aduhai.

36:45.888 --> 36:46.976
Aduhai.

36:47.767 --> 36:49.633
Jangan risau.

